# LF in the repo, always. Two reasons, both learned the hard way elsewhere:
#  - the app's sync compares a proposed grammar.json against the repo file BYTE for BYTE
#    (isRepoFileInSync); a CRLF checkout would make every file read as drifted forever.
#  - CRLF turned one CHANGELOG merge into a whole-file conflict and grew it to 17.6 MB.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
